{"asset_key":"ep7/quest_story_17107075","episode":"ep7","category":"quest_story","story_id":"17107075","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1710707501:1":{"text":"...약을 가져오거라.","source_cn":"……把药拿过来。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8908D4B897BFA102","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1710707502:1":{"text":"카짐은 망설임 없이 고통을 삼키며, 탁자 위 약병을 집어 들고 무릎으로 기어 침대 곁으로 다가갔다.","source_cn":"卡兹姆没有迟疑，他忍着刚刚的余痛，拿起桌上的药瓶，膝行...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8470602995CF4BD7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1710707503:1":{"text":"그리고는 약을 손바닥에 발라, 왕자의 등에 난 흉측한 흉터 위를 조심스럽게 덮었다.","source_cn":"他将药液倒在掌心，轻轻地覆上了王子背那道狰狞的伤疤。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x474C535687C89D2F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1710707504:1":{"text":"후우...","source_cn":"嘶……<key:dialog27>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD5F06FD212691388","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1710707505:1":{"text":"...아프, 십니까?","source_cn":"……很痛吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1E245ADB0A8AD0D7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1710707506:1":{"text":"아프냐고? 내가 그걸 직접 <style=\"highlight\">도려냈을</style> 때의 고통에 비하면... 아무것도 아니다.","source_cn":"痛？这点痛，比起我那天亲手把它们<style=high...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x18320C71AA86FB71","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1710707507:1":{"text":"죄송합니다. 전...","source_cn":"对不起，我……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2544B24F5B358813","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1710707508:1":{"text":"왜? 이게 바로 네가 보고 싶은 것 아니었나? 이 비참한 상처를 보면서 내가... 무엇인지 끊임없이 상기하라는 거겠지!","source_cn":"怎么？这不正是你想看到的吗？看着这可悲的伤口，时刻提醒...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x518EA89DA4C8C250","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1710707509:1":{"text":"그런, 생각... 한 적, 없습니다. 어떤 상황이든... 왕자님은... 고귀하십니다...","source_cn":"我从未……那样想过。 无论如何……您都是高贵的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x100E1A5DC3D9F184","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1710707510:1":{"text":"닥쳐라! 여기서 그런 소리를 듣다니... 역겹기 짝이 없군!","source_cn":"闭嘴！在这种地方说这种话只会让我觉得恶心！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0384C2FDA040868B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1710707511:1":{"text":"이 망할 가시와 깃털만 없었더라면... 그날 네가 나타나지 않았더라면... 세상에 이 비밀을 아는 사람은 없었을 텐데...","source_cn":"如果没有这该死的骨刺和羽毛……如果那天你没有出现……如...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC00F0DFB4ED44506","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1710707512:1":{"text":"차라리... 네 심장을 으깨버렸어야 했는데!","source_cn":"我真应该……直接捏碎你的心脏！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF8AA8FC860F0632E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1710707513:1":{"text":"그걸... 바라시는 거라면... 제 목숨은... 왕자님의... 것입니다...","source_cn":"如果……那是您的、愿望。我的命……本来、就属于您。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE88F889DB6207C80","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1710707514:1":{"text":"그런 표정 짓지 마라. 내가 못 할 것 같은가?","source_cn":"别摆出这幅样子，你以为我不敢吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x18B7AEB0006D15A5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1710707515:1":{"text":"하지만... 그 후에는? 네가 나타난 그날부터 내 인생은 망가졌지.","source_cn":"可是……之后呢？从你出现的那天起，我的人生就被毁掉了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x47CC11F62CD1E9D9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1710707516:1":{"text":"...","source_cn